<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Silk production runs through our own facility, with momme weight and construction set to your specification rather than chosen from a limited stock a trading company happens to hold. Most of our mulberry silk apparel falls between 16 and 22 momme, the range typical for blouses and dresses, with lighter and heavier weights available. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification applies.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Silk's cost reflects real production constraints — a single silkworm's cocoon yields only a small fraction of the filament needed for one garment — which is why minimum orders and pricing for silk differ from our standard cotton or synthetic programs. Our minimum order is 300 pieces per style, with fabric sourcing, sampling, bulk manufacturing, quality inspection, and export documentation handled in-house.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">On a premium fabric like silk, Bangladesh's trade position has an outsized effect on landed cost: EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms continues through November 2029 despite LDC graduation in November 2026, and a 20% cap on US tariffs negotiated in late 2025 limits further exposure versus Chinese-sourced silk facing Section 301 duties. That advantage, on top of factory-direct FOB pricing, meaningfully widens margin on a fabric where per-unit cost is already high.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
